{"id":"8513aea4cdfb45f5","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FProofRow.md","title":"FProofRow","display":"FProofRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FProofRow","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","g","z1373","z1374","z1375"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FProofRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>z1373</span><span>z1374</span><span>z1375</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶证明。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>z1373</code>、<code>z1374</code>、<code>z1375</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FProofRow E F R f r g z1373 z1374 z1375)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1376\n  (exists z1377\n    (and\n      (@ Pair z1376 z1377 z1375)\n      (and\n        (@ FFm E F R f r z1376)\n        (and\n          (@ Finite z1377)\n          (and\n            (@ Subset z1377 g)\n            (or\n              (and (@ FAx E F R f r z1376) (@ Empty z1377))\n              (or\n                (and (in z1376 g) (@ Single z1376 z1377))\n                (or\n                  (exists z1379\n                    (exists z1380\n                      (exists z1381\n                        (exists z1382\n                          (and\n                            (exists z1383\n                            (exists z1384 (and (in z1383 z1374) (and (@ App z1373 z1383 z1384) (@ Pair z1379 z1381 z1384)))))\n                            (and\n                            (exists z1385\n                            (exists z1386 (and (in z1385 z1374) (and (@ App z1373 z1385 z1386) (@ Pair z1380 z1382 z1386)))))\n                            (and (@ PImp z1379 z1376 z1380) (@ Union2 z1381 z1382 z1377))))))))\n                  (or\n                    (exists z1387\n                      (exists z1388\n                        (and\n                          (@ Nat z1387)\n                          (and\n                            (exists z1389\n                            (exists z1390 (and (in z1389 z1374) (and (@ App z1373 z1389 z1390) (@ Pair z1388 z1377 z1390)))))\n                            (and\n                            (@ FAll z1387 z1388 z1376)\n                            (forall z1380 (implies (in z1380 z1377) (not (@ FFree E F R f r z1387 z1380)))))))))\n                    (exists z1388\n                      (and\n                        (exists z1391\n                          (exists z1392 (and (in z1391 z1374) (and (@ App z1373 z1391 z1392) (@ Pair z1388 z1377 z1392)))))\n                        (@ FAlpha E F R f r z1388 z1376)))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6471a8f381739eb\" href=\"?note=b6471a8f381739eb\" title=\"ZFC_Empty\">Empty</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b01633bdf3140514\" href=\"?note=b01633bdf3140514\" title=\"ZFC_FAll\">FAll</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"394f65c7afb19850\" href=\"?note=394f65c7afb19850\" title=\"ZFC_FAlpha\">FAlpha</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4a1c0902ef42ab95\" href=\"?note=4a1c0902ef42ab95\" title=\"ZFC_FAx\">FAx</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\